Error [jet.DebugTraceInRelease]: A `debug` trace is left at `debug_trace.jet:8`.
  --> debug_trace.jet:8:14
    |
  8 |     total :: debug(word.len() * 3)
    |              ^^^^^
 Why: `debug(value)` is a development trace: it prints while you run, test, or interpret a program and adds no effect, so a shipped artifact (`jet build`) or a release-profile build must not contain it.
 Fix: Remove the `debug(…)` wrapper and keep the expression; `jet fix` applies this edit.
